            "text": "I'm unable to process a refund for order 1005 at this time. Here's why:\n\n**Order Details:**\n- Item: Office chair\n- Amount: $210.00\n- Purchase date: 3 days ago\n- Status: In transit\n\n**Refund Eligibility:** Not eligible\n\n**Reason:** According to our refund policy, **\"The order must have been delivered.\"** Your order is currently in transit and has not yet been delivered.\n\nThe relevant policy states:\n> \"Refund policy:\n> 1. An order is refundable within 30 days of purchase.\n> 2. Final-sale items are not refundable.\n> 3. **The order must have been delivered.**\"\n\nWhile your order meets the first two criteria (it's within 30 days and not a final-sale item), it hasn't been delivered yet, which is a requirement for processing refunds.\n\n**Next Steps:** Once your order is delivered, you'll be eligible for a refund within 30 days of the purchase date. You can contact us again after delivery if you still wish to return the office chair.",
